               <text>
                  <paragraph>anhydrous citric acid, D&amp;C red no. 33, FD&amp;C blue no. 1, flavors, glycerin, high fructose corn syrup, microcrystalline cellulose and carboxymethylcellulose sodium, purified water, sodium benzoate, sorbitol solution, sucralose, xanthan gum</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20200521"/>
            </section>
         </component>
